# DESK31 items 5 + 6 -- the two wordings that diverged.
#
#   B_CSEL       the C: drive icon selected
#   C_RMVDEL     the C: icon dropped on the TRASH -> `wants_to_delete_files`,
#                which since DESK31 is EmuTOS's STRMVDEL: "Do you want to
#                remove icons|or delete files?" with the buttons in the order
#                Icons | Files | Cancel (desk_rsc.c:2523-2524).  Before DESK31
#                this was a NewTOS `fun_confirm` reading "Delete the selected
#                item(s)?" with Cancel | OK.
#   D_CANCELLED  its Cancel taken -- nothing is deleted
#   E_PRNT       the C: icon dropped on the PRINTER -> `illegal_op_msg()`,
#                i.e. STILLOP "Illegal operation!" (desk_rsc.c:2497).  Before
#                DESK31 this site said "Operation not allowed."
#
# Coordinates from the probe run: C: (38,35), TRASH (38,449), PRINTER (584,449).
# The alert buttons come from this run's own [alert] dump.
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1600 move 38 35
2000 down
2003 up
2400 parkbr
3000 mark B_CSEL
3400 move 38 35
3800 down
3900 drag 38 449
4600 up
4900 parkbr
6000 mark C_RMVDEL
# -- Cancel (400,269 from this run's [alert] dump), then drop the same icon on
#    the PRINTER, which is `fun_desk2desk`'s "neither disk nor trash" arm.
6400 move 400 269
6800 down
7000 up
7600 parkbr
8400 mark D_CANCELLED
8800 move 38 35
9200 down
9203 up
9600 parkbr
10200 mark D2_CSEL
10600 move 38 35
11000 down
11100 drag 584 449
11900 up
12200 parkbr
13400 mark E_PRNT
13800 move 320 269
14200 down
14400 up
15000 parkbr
15800 mark F_END
